    "title": "Here's why I voted for Proposition 1, and I think you should too | Letters To Editor | wyomingnews.com",
    "text": "I have no kids or grandkids, but I have to pay for Wyoming schools.\nWhat I do have is my home in Cheyenne. The other states I've lived in, with ever-increasing taxes, force people out of their homes.\nThe 68,000 Wyoming government employees (8,000 teachers) want me to keep paying their salaries, even though government always eventually runs out of \"other people's money.\" (MINE!)\nNO! I voted for Prop 1.",
